   └─ for owner case9
      ├─ at reach default
      │  ├─ set the key
      │  │  ├─
      │  │  │
      │  │  │
      │  │  └─
      │  └─ get after set, to verify
      │     ├─ ✓ rhx keyrack unlock --key MULTI_REACH_KEY --env test --owner case9
      │     └─ ✓ rhx keyrack get --key MULTI_REACH_KEY --env test --owner case9
      ├─ at reach beav@ehmpathy.com
      │  ├─ set the key
      │  │  ├─
      │  │  │
      │  │  │
      │  │  └─
      │  └─ get after set, to verify
      │     ├─ ✓ rhx keyrack unlock --key MULTI_REACH_KEY --env test --owner case9 --reach beav@ehmpathy.com
      │     └─ ✓ rhx keyrack get --key MULTI_REACH_KEY --env test --owner case9 --reach beav@ehmpathy.com
      └─ at reach vlad@ehmpathy.com
         ├─ set the key
         │  ├─
         │  │
         │  │
         │  └─
         └─ get after set, to verify
            ├─ ✓ rhx keyrack unlock --key MULTI_REACH_KEY --env test --owner case9 --reach vlad@ehmpathy.com
            └─ ✓ rhx keyrack get --key MULTI_REACH_KEY --env test --owner case9 --reach vlad@ehmpathy.com

🔐 keyrack fill complete (4/4 keys verified)
"
